{"id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton.md","title":"确定性 PDA 的互斥条件","display":"df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton — 确定性 PDA 的互斥条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","aliases":["73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton"],"display":"df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton — 确定性 PDA 的互斥条件","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-structure]]","[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§5.2, pp. 112–113; Chapter 10, pp. 234–238; scans 120–121, 242–246","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton — 确定性 PDA 的互斥条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" href=\"?note=3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" title=\"73-df-pda-structure\">73-df-pda-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§5.2, pp. 112–113; Chapter 10, pp. 234–238; scans 120–121, 242–246"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是候选 PDA；结构判断后令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\)</span> 为有效实例。PDA 有限转移集与终态语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" href=\"?note=3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" title=\"73-df-pda-structure\">73-df-pda-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\Bigl[M=N\n\\land\\forall q\\in\\pi_1(N)\\;\\forall X\\in\\pi_3(N)\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;|(\\pi_4(N))(q,a,X)|\\le1\\\\\n&amp;\\land((\\pi_4(N))(q,\\varepsilon,X)\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\pi_4(N))(q,a,X)=\\varnothing)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\Bigl[M=N\n\\land\\forall q\\in\\pi_1(N)\\;\\forall X\\in\\pi_3(N)\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\;|(\\pi_4(N))(q,a,X)|\\le1\\\\\n&amp;\\land((\\pi_4(N))(q,\\varepsilon,X)\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\pi_4(N))(q,a,X)=\\varnothing)\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_F(M):M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_F(M):M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单值性只解决同一标签上的选择；还必须排除同一状态与栈顶同时有 ε 步和读入步，否则仍然非确定。DCFL 使用终态接受，不能直接套用任意 NPDA 的终态／空栈转换保持确定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3ded707d0dbfc1eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","a